---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Use | Finicky Bee"
  description="Read the Finicky Bee Terms of Use for information about using the website, research content, marketplace links, and related materials."
>
  <main>
    <header class="site-header">
      <div class="header-inner">
        <a href="/" class="brand">FINICKY BEE</a>

        <nav>
          <a href="/">Home</a>
          <a href="/#finds">Finicky Bee Finds</a>
          <a href="/#collection">Collection</a>
          <a href="/#research">Research</a>
          <a href="/#about">About</a>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </header>

    <section class="legal-hero">
      <div class="narrow">
        <p class="eyebrow">TERMS</p>
        <h1>Terms of Use</h1>

        <p class="intro">
          These Terms of Use describe the general terms that apply when
          visiting and using the Finicky Bee website.
        </p>

        <p class="updated">Effective September 22, 2026</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-content section">
      <div class="narrow">
        <h2>About Finicky Bee</h2>

        <p>
          Finicky Bee is an independent collecting, research, documentation,
          storytelling, and resale business focused on vintage and antique
          collectibles and the stories connected to them.
        </p>

        <p>
          The website provides information about Finicky Bee, its collections,
          research, documentary work, and related activities.
        </p>

        <h2>Use of This Website</h2>

        <p>
          You may access and use this website for lawful personal and
          informational purposes.
        </p>

        <p>
          You may not use the website in a way that interferes with its
          operation, attempts to gain unauthorized access, introduces
          malicious code, or otherwise harms the website or its users.
        </p>

        <h2>Website Content</h2>

        <p>
          Finicky Bee makes reasonable efforts to present research,
          observations, historical information, photographs, and other
          content accurately and responsibly.
        </p>

        <p>
          Research concerning vintage and antique objects may involve
          incomplete evidence, conflicting sources, uncertainty, or later
          discoveries. Information presented on this website should therefore
          be understood in the context of the evidence available at the time
          of publication.
        </p>

        <p>
          Finicky Bee may correct, update, or expand website content when new
          information becomes available.
        </p>

        <h2>Research and Identification</h2>

        <p>
          Finicky Bee's research and identification content is provided for
          informational, educational, documentary, and collecting purposes.
        </p>

        <p>
          Website research should not be interpreted as a guarantee of
          authenticity, provenance, historical attribution, market value,
          condition, or future resale value.
        </p>

        <p>
          Finicky Bee does not provide appraisal or valuation services through
          this website.
        </p>

        <h2>Photographs and Original Content</h2>

        <p>
          Photographs, written material, documentary content, branding,
          graphics, and other original material created by or for Finicky Bee
          may be protected by applicable intellectual property laws.
        </p>

        <p>
          You may not reproduce, republish, modify, distribute, sell, or use
          Finicky Bee's original website content for commercial purposes
          without appropriate permission, except where permitted by law.
        </p>

        <h2>Third-Party Marketplaces</h2>

        <p>
          Finicky Bee may offer collectibles for sale through third-party
          marketplaces, including eBay and Etsy.
        </p>

        <p>
          Purchases made through a third-party marketplace are subject to the
          terms, policies, procedures, and protections of that marketplace in
          addition to any applicable terms associated with the transaction.
        </p>

        <p>
          Questions, messages, returns, order issues, shipping matters, and
          other communications concerning a marketplace order must be handled
          through the marketplace associated with that order.
        </p>

        <h2>External Links</h2>

        <p>
          The Finicky Bee website may contain links to external websites,
          marketplaces, social platforms, or other third-party resources.
        </p>

        <p>
          Finicky Bee does not control and is not responsible for the content,
          availability, security, privacy practices, or policies of external
          websites.
        </p>

        <h2>Website Availability</h2>

        <p>
          Finicky Bee may modify, update, suspend, or discontinue portions of
          the website or its content at any time.
        </p>

        <p>
          While reasonable efforts may be made to keep the website available
          and functioning properly, Finicky Bee does not guarantee that the
          website will always be available, uninterrupted, or free of errors.
        </p>

        <h2>Changes to These Terms</h2>

        <p>
          Finicky Bee may update these Terms of Use when the website, business
          practices, or applicable requirements change. Updated terms will be
          posted on this page with a revised effective date.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>

        <p>
  For questions concerning these Terms of Use or the Finicky Bee
  website, please email <strong>info@finickybee.com</strong>.
</p>

        <p>
          For orders or transactions made through a third-party marketplace,
          please use the communication tools provided by the marketplace
          associated with that order.
        </p>

        <p class="legal-note">
          These Terms of Use are intended as general website information and
          should be reviewed and adapted for the specific legal and
          operational requirements of the business.
        </p>

        <a href="/" class="text-link">← Return to Finicky Bee</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <footer class="site-footer">
      <div>
        <p class="footer-brand">FINICKY BEE</p>
        <p>Preserving Moments in Time — One Collectible at a Time.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="footer-links">
        <a href="/#about">About</a>
        <a href="/#research">Research</a>
        <a href="/#collection">Collection</a>
        <a href="/#finds">Finicky Bee Finds</a>
      </div>

      <p class="copyright">
        © {new Date().getFullYear()} Finicky Bee. All rights reserved.
      </p>
    </footer>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  :global(body) {
    margin: 0;
    background: #f7f3ea;
    color: #30302c;
    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .site-header {
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(47, 79, 63, 0.15);
    background: #f7f3ea;
  }

  .header-inner {
    max-width: 1180px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 22px 28px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 30px;
  }

  .brand {
    color: #2f4f3f;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  nav {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 22px;
  }

  nav a {
    color: #30302c;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
  }

  nav a:hover,
  .text-link:hover {
    color: #2f4f3f;
  }

  .legal-hero {
    padding: 100px 28px 70px;
    background: #efe9dc;
  }

  .narrow {
    max-width: 820px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 14px;
    color: #8b6b1f;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
  }

  h1,
  h2 {
    font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
    color: #2f4f3f;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  h1 {
    margin: 0 0 24px;
    font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 6vw, 4.8rem);
    line-height: 1.05;
  }

  h2 {
    margin: 52px 0 16px;
    font-size: 2rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  h2:first-child {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .intro {
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
  }

  .updated {
    margin: 0;
    color: #68685f;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .legal-content {
    padding: 80px 28px;
  }

  .legal-content p {
    margin: 0 0 18px;
  }

  .legal-note {
    margin-top: 60px !important;
    padding-top: 24px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(47, 79, 63, 0.15);
    color: #68685f;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .text-link {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 28px;
    color: #2f4f3f;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .site-footer {
    max-width: 1180px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 55px 28px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(47, 79, 63, 0.15);
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.5fr 1fr;
    gap: 30px;
  }

  .footer-brand {
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    color: #2f4f3f;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  }

  .footer-links {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 16px 22px;
  }

  .footer-links a {
    color: #30302c;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .copyright {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    margin: 20px 0 0;
    color: #68685f;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .header-inner {
      align-items: flex-start;
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    nav {
      gap: 12px 18px;
    }

    .legal-hero {
      padding: 70px 22px 55px;
    }

    .legal-content {
      padding: 60px 22px;
    }

    .site-footer {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      padding: 45px 22px;
    }

    .copyright {
      grid-column: auto;
    }
  }
</style>